commit cf4dfefb
author: cdvankammen
date: 2026-10-22 15:04:36 -0600
subject: feat(merge-prep): stage all local work for upstream merge

Includes:
- CLI token protection for MCP endpoints (SEC-3674)
- Tray watchdog + Jetsam keepalive (tray freeze fix)
- Per-IP rate limiter in CLI package
- WAL checkpoint TRUNCATE -> PASSIVE fixes
- Failover proxy improvements (IPv6, multi-peer, auto-discovery)
- Combo/models feature work (sorting, overrides, import)
- Test coverage additions (jwt, mcp-auth, rate-limiter, failover)
- Plans-and-prompts docs reorganization
- i18n README updates


